---
import Prose from '../layouts/Prose.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../site.config.mjs';
---
<Prose title="Disclaimer" description={`Accuracy, affiliation and advertising disclaimers for ${SITE.name}.`}>
  <h2>No affiliation</h2>
  <p>
    {SITE.name} is an independent reference site. We are not affiliated with, endorsed by, or
    managed by any person profiled here, nor by their agents, studios, teams or labels. Names are
    used for identification and commentary only.
  </p>

  <h2>Accuracy</h2>
  <p>
    Profiles are compiled from open public records that can be incomplete or out of date. We publish
    what the record says and link to it, so you can verify anything yourself. Spot a mistake?
    <a href="/contact/">Tell us</a> and it gets fixed.
  </p>

  <h2>No net-worth guarantees</h2>
  <p>
    We deliberately publish no invented net-worth totals. Where financial context appears, it
    describes documented income sources, not an audited valuation, and must not be relied on for any
    financial decision.
  </p>

  <h2>Advertising</h2>
  <p>
    Pages may carry third-party advertising, which is served independently of our editorial process.
    Advertisers have no influence on which profiles we publish or what they say.
  </p>

  <h2>Fair use of images</h2>
  <p>
    Portraits are used only under free licences that permit reuse, with photographer, licence and
    source credited. If you hold rights in an image and believe it is used incorrectly, see the
    <a href="/dmca/">DMCA page</a>.
  </p>
</Prose>
